        } else {
          ()
        }
        ki0 = ki0 + 1
      }
      // #3149: a formal the body bound to a CONCRETE HEAD whose arguments are
      // still open (`T := Array[?e]`, the binding an Array builtin makes,
      // #3006) is substituted into the scheme like a fully concrete one, so a
      // caller passing a Map is a type error at the call. The variables left
